	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hwah!? Madam President and Soujin-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good day to you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry to drop in unannounced.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes go wide at our unexpected presidential visit.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"She fidgets in place and sits up a little straighter than usual.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Madam President! What an auspicious day it is to be graced with your presence after your long and arduous journey all the way to my humble...!”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Er, we just drove over, you know... And please, won't you drop the formalities?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just call me Elsa, like you always did.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A-Absolutely, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I just wanted to check in. How are you getting along?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am in magnificent health! I even had a wonderfully large extra helping of rice this morning!”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Er, that's all well and good, but I'm asking about your work on the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, that would indeed make more sense.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Kotone flushes with embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She fldgets with her hands and mumbles under her breath, all the while meaningfully avoiding Elsa's gaze.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, um... Regarding that particular matter...”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-We unfortunately encountered an array of unexpected problems, and I am afraid that they are all of a rather inscrutable and unworkable nature...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I haven't got all day...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I'm terribly sorry! We have not made even the slightest progress!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Kotone dives facefirst onto the ground, laying herself right at Elsa's feet.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hey, what do you think you're doing?! Stand up!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I take full responsibility for this failure!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The other priestesses bear none of the blame! I beg of you, please allow me to accept the entirety of the punishment myself!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I say, don't you think you're more than a little confused?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Did you not come here with the express intent to reprimand me?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Certainly not.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Elsa stares down at Kotone's still-prostrate form, rubbing her temples as though she feels a headache coming on.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"After finishing our routine inspection of the Barrier and commending the priestesses for their efforts, Elsa dejectedly slumps her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kotone sure jumps to conclusions as quick as ever.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was totally your fault this time, though.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's what happens when you just show up without any prior notice”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Elsa frequently conducts on-site inspections to better inform her policy decisions.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It's apparently important for democratic leaders to not just hand down orders, but to consult the relevant experts on the ground in order to arrive at a consensus.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"This seems to me like a laudable principle, but for some reason, she chose to conduct all her inspections today entirely unannounced.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"As a result, I was the only bodyguard available to escort her on such short notice.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I feel like it ought to be a great honor for the President to drop by in person.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It freaks most people out.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"It's only natural to be sweating bullets when you find yourself subject to an impromptu inspection.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"And so, I can't exactly blame Kotone for her unfortunate misunderstanding.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Incidentally, we're currently headed for the Sworn Blades' former headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"It's currently being used as a station for the warriors\nwho've enlisted in the Imperial Police.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you given Hotori a call?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nope?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I know it's already too late, so I don't bother arguing.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Instead, I type out a quick e-mail, figuring that I can at least give her some heads-up.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"As I send it off, I can't help but feel like letting out a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What is it this time around?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Even when dealing with the President, the light in Hotori's eyes is just as sharp as ever.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"As the captain of the warrior division in the Imperial Police, Hotori never has a dull moment running around Tenkyo day in and day out.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Considering her busy schedule, a sudden unannounced visit from the President must be quite the nuisance.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I just came by to check if your spellblades are being stored and inventoried appropriately.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We've made no oversights.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“More importantly, didn't I tell you last time to give me a\nday's notice if you're planning a visit?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Hotori glares at us, and I apologize instead of Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I won't get in your way. I'll look around on my own, so just pretend I'm not even here.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How am I supposed to just ignore the President?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"In the end, Hotori grudgingly accompanies us anyways.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“These are clean enough to eat off. The way you keep up your maintenance is as impressive as ever.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Elsa gazes intently at an unsheathed spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Next to her, Hotori sullenly crosses her arms.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Proper maintainence of one's blade is the first lesson taught to all warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Also, there's really no need to swing them around. I can't settle down thinking you're gonna cut yourself at any moment.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's the harm? It's just a little test.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You know, I've actually taken an interest in blade arts recently.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehe, Soujin gives me private lessons once in a while.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Elsa takes a few steps between the two of us...",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"And swings the blade in her hand down with all her might.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How was that, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your center of gravity is off. You need to work on strengthening your core.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't you be giving her pointers here.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Hotori sends a reproachful glare my way.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"She sidles up next to me, making sure to keep a watchful eye on Elsa's amateurish antics with her blade.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(You're the only one who can talk sense into her when she gets like this. Get your act together.)”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I'll try my best.)”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"That said, my job is to protect her safety, not act as her babysitter.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, I think that's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But we came out all this way. I was hoping Inou-san might give me a few pointers...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll fall flat on your butt again if you keep that up.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Her butt, you say?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“H-Hey, why'd you have to bring that up?!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Elsa turns beet red, her blade limply falling down to her side.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"It happened a while back when Elsa asked me to give her some training.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hah! Yaah!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Elsa tries swinging the wooden blade like I showed her.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"But she's putting too much strength in her hands, and her stance and her form are both too crude.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, you're focusing too hard on your grip.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You have to swing the blade with your entire body.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“With my whole body... I see.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yaaaaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"She lets loose with a wide, full-body slash.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I didn't mean going all-out like that.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“O-Oh, really?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Awwaah... aaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Elsa staggers, loses her balance, and lands spectacularly right on her butt.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oooh...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"She gingerly rubs her rear end, her eyes on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Still crumpled on the ground, she turns to face me, her face red as a tomato.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You didn't see anything. Got it?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah... got it. Nothing to see here.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, is your butt still feeling sore?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This guy doesn't get it at all!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"It was a rare sight to see Elsa like that, so of course I still remember it clearly.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Hotori can't suppress the grin spreading across her face.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, Madam President, has your rear end recovered nicely since then?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“None of your business!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, you'd better remember this...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“A-Anyways, that does it for my inspection of your headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Elsa hastily hands the spellblade back to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inou-san, I'm sorry for taking up so much of your time.\nWe're always counting on you in the event of an ermergency.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's get a move on, Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Another inspection?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“To Miyoshi. We haven't had lunch yet, right?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Elsa beats a hasty retreat from the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Hotori shoots me a look of incredulity.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're doing a surprisingly good job of handling her.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She is my fiancée, after all. I should think that I'd know everything there is to know about her.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aww, jeez... there he goes again. Spare me.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I wave goodbye to an exasperated Hotori and chase after Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"As always, Miyoshi is bustling with warriors.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Without exception, everyone does a double-take upon noticing Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's the President doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What else? I'm hungry.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Akari and Elsa are sitting on either side of me.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"We were shown to the counter seats and happened to run into Akari.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Elsa, have you lost some weight?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't worry, I'm getting more than enough food and sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You told me that you went to bed at three-thirty last night, and that you barely even touched your breakfast this morning.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hey! What're you telling her for?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Elsa glares at me reproachfully.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Because if I don't, you won't do anything to fix it.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But I can't just leave my work unfinished.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm the only one in charge of these things, so I can't afford to cut any corners.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know, but I'm still worried about you.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm perfectly fine. Just the fact that you're worried about me already has me feeling a million times better.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Saying this, Elsa cutely rests her head on my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Get a room, you two.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Akari feeds herself with a fed-up expression.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you know, you really need to stay healthy, for the whole country's sake. You should at least make sure you're eating well.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should also try to stop being such a picky eater.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What was it again that she couldn't handle? Broccoli?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. She always slides it to my plate and pretends to not notice.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“S-Stop telling her all this!”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Elsa tries to cover up my mouth in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Akari simply looks between the two of us while giggling.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I thought she'd be wearing the pants in this relationship, but looks like I was mistaken.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Does she act all cutesy when you two are alone together?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Oh, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's enough out of you!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Akari and I share a knowing smile.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, you'd better remember this too...”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm definitely gonna get you back for everything you said about me today.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Paying no heed to the murderous glare coming my way, I calmly sip my tea.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"After a while, Akari sets her chopsticks down and stands up.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm heading out. You two have fun.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're going already?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A newly elected member of Parliament can't afford to be slacking.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That goes for you too, Madam President. If you idle your term away, some up-and-coming challenger just might pull the rug out from under you.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As ambitious as ever, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You scared?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Certainly not. The rest of Parliament is far too complacent, so I look forward to seeing the waves you'll make.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Akari walks out of the restaurant with a motivated smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Wearing the exact same expression, Elsa watches her walk away until she leaves our line of sight.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, are we heading back to the Government-General after this?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nah, I'm rather tired, so I was thinking of taking a little rest in your room.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You wouldn't mind, would you? We are close by, after all...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"If she really wanted to rest, heading back to the Government-General would be more convenient.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I think about mentioning this, but I decide to keep my mouth shut.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"It's been a long time since Elsa's wanted to come to my place, so I'll happily permit it.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haahhh... This is so relaxing.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"The moment we arrive, Elsa lays out the futon and lies down.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Her uniform is getting wrinkled, but she doesn't seem to care.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's not good to act so sloppy.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's fine, it's fine. There's no problem if it's just you and me.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“By the way, a nice cup of black tea would really hit the spot right about now...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I only have regular tea.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmph, you could at least stock up on what your fiancée likes.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What're you gonna do when we move in together?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Elsa puffs out her cheeks and starts kicking her legs around.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"I've seen plenty of small children more well-behaved than\nshe's acting right now.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"I feel slightly embarrassed that this is the woman currently occupying the office of the Empire's President.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know, Soujin. You can give me a foot massage instead.\nPresident's orders.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm awfully exhausted from walking around all morning...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Since when can the President issue orders like that?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, massage meeee.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Elsa begs in a whiny tone while rolling all around the futon.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Good grief...",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"I give up and decide it would be easier to just follow the\nPresident's orders.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Lie on your stomach.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehe, thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I grab Elsa's shapely legs and begin massaging them.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right by my calves... ahh...! Mmmnnh... that's the spot... right there...”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nnh... haaah... that feels nice...”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Elsa unreservedly moans as I massage her.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Her sighs of satisfaction sound awfully erotic, and I start getting some weird ideas as I'm forced to listen to them.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your legs feel a lot stiffer than usual.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Really now? Perhaps I'm more exhausted than I realized.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Or rather, it's awfully interesting that you remember how soft they usually are, you dirty boy.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Elsa smirks at me mischievously.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"I've touched them many times, so it's only natural I'd remember.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm? Whaaat?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd really like it if you'd stop pushing yourself so hard.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm not pushing myself at all.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's just so much I want to get done, so I can't afford to rest all I want.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then at least get some rest while you're here.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You haven't been sleeping much recently, have you?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Say, Soujin. You don't seriously believe I came here to take a nap, do you?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Elsa glares at me with a sulky expression.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why do you think I arranged this grand tour of impromptu inspections in the first place?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I only did it to be able to spend some time with you.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Elsa crawls over on all fours and cozies up right next to me.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"I want to embrace her right this minute, but I shouldn't be monopolizing the President's time like this.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about your official duties?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've already taken care of everything that I need to today, so there shouldn't be any problems at all.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That is, unless you'd prefer your President to act more responsibly...”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, no, not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For my part, I'm sorry I made you feel so lonely.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee, you'll be making it up to me, right? I'm looking forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Elsa fixes me with her best come-hither look.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"I slowly bring my face in towards her...",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Or, is that what you thought I'd say?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mhhn.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Elsa firmly plants a finger to my lips and prevents me from coming even an inch closer.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"She shows me a perfectly practiced smile that doesn't quite reach her cold, narrowed eyes, and the look sends a shiver down my spine.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You suuure made a fool out of me today... didn't you, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Telling Inou-san and Miyaguni-san aaaall those embarrassing things...”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I was just...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Some sad warrior you are, making excuses like that.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Elsa croons sweetly as she runs a finger down my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was planning to take things niiice and slow with you today, but you changed my mind...”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's only fair I pay you back for everything you did to me today... don't you think?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, won't you be a good boy and lie down for me?”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Utterly powerless to resist her, I do exactly as I'm told.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Elsa gazes down at me with a sly, toying grin...",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Despite Elsa being out of breath, she's clearly happy.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Haah... haah... haaah...”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehe... hehee...”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Today marks the day of my triumphant first victory.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Elsa gloatingly teases me.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you happy now?”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yeeep, very much so.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I got to see so many embarrassing sides of you today, so I think I'll let you off the hook.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Contented with having finally gotten her payback for today, Elsa directs a gleaming smile down at me.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's an awfully cute smile.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Doesn't beat how cute you were just a few minutes ago, though.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tha─”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Her perfect counterattack causes me to fall silent.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"She's gonna hold this over me for quite a while, it seems...",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Understanding my inferior position, I quickly try to change the subject.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're staying over today?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yeeep... I think I'll finally get a good night's sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, I just had quite the workout...”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"At best, she only ever sneaks a quick power nap or two in her office.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"If this means that Elsa can finally get some good rest, I'll be a happy man.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have to admit though... tormenting you sure was fun...”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I reeeaally wouldn't mind doing this more often... Besides, you secretly liked it too, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wouldn't really say that I...”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"But I can't quite bring myself to finish my sentence.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Elsa flashes a wicked grin at my hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, we should cut this out, for your own good.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right back at you.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyways, shall we take a bath together?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"Right as she prepares to stand up, Elsa seemingly comes up with a very good (bad) idea.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah... I just came up with a fun little game... Wanna try it out in the bath?”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee, I think I just might get hooked on tormenting you like this...”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"How much longer does her presidential term last again?",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"The entire Empire might be heading down a dark and dangerous road...",
			},
		},
	},
